title: A cherry-pick that conflicts shows the banner and the conflicted file; taking their side and continuing finishes it
folders: git-conflict
expect-file: git-conflict/notes.txt :: beta from topic
expect-file: git-conflict/.git/logs/HEAD :: cherry-pick.*topic change
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3500
left changes
wait 1500
palette Open All Commits
wait 500
press enter
wait 2500
mark a-commits
wait 500
ui right 1100 204
wait 1000
mark b-menu
wait 500
ui click 1200 322
wait 2500
mark c-banner
wait 500
wait 500
ui click 222 650
wait 2500
mark d-took-theirs
wait 500
ui click 103 162
wait 2500
mark e-finished
wait 500
quit
